[{:db/id -1
  :adr/id "ADR-0003"
  :adr/title "Publish the consent-bound agent surface without publishing high-stakes effects"
  :adr/status :accepted
  :adr/body "Deploy the classifieds UI and a small Cloudflare Worker as the public transport host. The Worker serves MCP over JSON-RPC, A2A v1 over JSON-RPC and HTTP+JSON, and a live Agent Card. MCP and A2A share one pure search/intake/match implementation so transport variants cannot silently diverge. Cloudflare Service Bindings read the health of the existing marketplace fulfillment and settlement actors; they do not inherit either actor's write credential. Shipment capability issuance recursively rejects postal-address and phone-shaped fields and returns only an opaque short-lived token. Escrow planning names the provider-capture, delivery-evidence, no-dispute and named-human gates but never moves money. Payment capture, transfer and escrow release routes always refuse. Signal protocol cryptography is browser-verified, while Signal Messenger delivery always refuses until a separately governed account-backed bridge exists. This separates deployed discovery and proposals from carrier booking, external messaging and payment execution."}]
